 -- : Y = movmean (X, WLEN)
 -- : Y = movmean (X, [NB, NA])
 -- : Y = movmean (..., DIM)
 -- : Y = movmean (..., NANCOND)
 -- : Y = movmean (..., PROPERTY, VALUE)
     Calculate the moving average over a sliding window of length WLEN
     on data X.

     The moving window length input WLEN can either be a numeric scalar
     or a 2-element numeric array ‘[NB, NA]’.  The elements included in
